<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dutch first division soccer played on Saturday:</p>
<p>NAC Breda 1 (MacDonald 60th) AZ Alkmaar 0. Halftime 0-0. Attendance: 11,458</p>
<p>Fortuna Sittard 1 (Hamming 30th) Utrecht 3 (Mols 29th 42nd, Van Loen 32nd). 1-3. 4,000.</p>
